@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@roomTypeId = a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@checkInDate = 2027-08-18
@checkOutDate = 2027-08-19

### 1. Tạo booking PENDING hợp lệ

POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "{{checkInDate}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{checkOutDate}}",
  "adults": 2,
  "children": 0,
  "guestInfo": {
    "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
    "email": "guest@gmail.com",
    "phone": "0901234567",
    "identityNumber": "012345678901"
  },
  "addOns": []
}

> {%
    client.global.set("bookingId", response.body.data.bookingId);
    client.global.set("bookingAccessToken", response.body.data.bookingAccessToken);
%}

### 2. Tạo yêu cầu thanh toán cho booking vừa tạo (fallback cho U015)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-Booking-Access-Token: {{bookingAccessToken}}

{
  "bookingId": "{{bookingId}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("paymentId", response.body.data.paymentId);
    client.global.set("paymentCode", response.body.data.transactionRef);
    client.global.set("paymentAmount", response.body.data.amount);
%}

### 3. Theo dõi trạng thái thanh toán
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/status
X-Booking-Access-Token: {{bookingAccessToken}}

### 4. Ngoại lệ - ngày trả không sau ngày nhận
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "{{checkInDate}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{checkInDate}}",
  "adults": 2,
  "children": 0,
  "guestInfo": {
    "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
    "email": "guest@gmail.com",
    "identityNumber": "012345678901"
  },
  "addOns": []
}

### 5. Ngoại lệ - vượt sức chứa
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomTypeId": "{{roomTypeId}}",
  "checkInDate": "{{checkInDate}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{checkOutDate}}",
  "adults": 99,
  "children": 99,
  "guestInfo": {
    "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
    "email": "guest@gmail.com",
    "identityNumber": "012345678901"
  },
  "addOns": []
}
